      "data": {
        "type": "game",
        "name": "UNIT ZERO Operation Black Veil",
        "steam_appid": 3822000,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822000/extras/958af2a32f22f864044055d8bf55cc3b.avif?t=1764820861\" width=616 height=410 /></span><strong>UNIT ZERO</strong> is a hyper-realistic first-person shooter blending tactical action, horror, and science fiction. Dive into intense multiplayer matches or fight off relentless waves in Zombies mode — all within an immersive, tension-filled atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A breach that should never have been opened...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desperate attempt to solve global overpopulation, a secret group of scientists launched a forbidden experiment: opening a dimensional rift to a parallel Earth.<br>A planet identical to ours. No humans. Untouched resources... or so they thought.<br>What awaited on the other side changed the fate of humanity forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic bodycam-style graphics</strong> that draw you deep into every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive multiplayer mode</strong>, built for tactical squads and fast-paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Zombies mode</strong>, where survival depends on teamwork and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark, disturbing story</strong> told through environmental details, hidden recordings, and classified documents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> that heightens the tension and amplifies the horror at every turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to cross the breach...<br>But remember: not everything that seems uninhabited is truly empty.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822000/extras/958af2a32f22f864044055d8bf55cc3b.avif?t=1764820861\" width=616 height=410 /></span><strong>UNIT ZERO</strong> is a hyper-realistic first-person shooter blending tactical action, horror, and science fiction. Dive into intense multiplayer matches or fight off relentless waves in Zombies mode — all within an immersive, tension-filled atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A breach that should never have been opened...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desperate attempt to solve global overpopulation, a secret group of scientists launched a forbidden experiment: opening a dimensional rift to a parallel Earth.<br>A planet identical to ours. No humans. Untouched resources... or so they thought.<br>What awaited on the other side changed the fate of humanity forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic bodycam-style graphics</strong> that draw you deep into every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive multiplayer mode</strong>, built for tactical squads and fast-paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Zombies mode</strong>, where survival depends on teamwork and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark, disturbing story</strong> told through environmental details, hidden recordings, and classified documents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> that heightens the tension and amplifies the horror at every turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to cross the breach...<br>But remember: not everything that seems uninhabited is truly empty.</p>",
        "short_description": "Unit Zero is a first-person multiplayer shooter with realistic bodycam-style graphics made in Unreal Engine 5. Includes competitive and cooperative zombie modes. Investigate what went wrong in the secret operation that unleashed the nightmare.",
        "supported_languages": "English",
